{"4246640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dungeon Brawls", "steam_appid": 4246640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4246640/extras/c722082b7e70e67708813f7b3113c6d2.avif?t=1788232487\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4246640/extras_big/c722082b7e70e67708813f7b3113c6d2.avif?t=1788232487 width=1560 height=936 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4246640/extras/28021ce71751ab2c710390bba76588b5.avif?t=1788232487\" width=970 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4246640/extras/32ec3b52953f4d424461ff2e77b0686c.avif?t=1788232487\" width=900 height=382 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4246640/extras/774269f69b5ee813662e2e8bad35f3d5.avif?t=1788232487\" width=970 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Massive Heroes × Roguelike Building × Mow-Down Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeon Brawls is an action roguelike game that supports 4-player co-op. Choose from dozens of available heroes, and freely combine hundreds of skills and relics. Team up with friends and challenge the bloody battles against hordes of enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4246640/extras/946a429bd507771e4dd5ae6c0fcc0f39.poster.avif?t=1788232487\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4246640/extras/946a429bd507771e4dd5ae6c0fcc0f39.webm?t=1788232487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4246640/extras/946a429bd507771e4dd5ae6c0fcc0f39.mp4?t=1788232487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer Co-op</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game supports 4-player online co-op. Fight solo or alongside friends, cleverly combine each character's strengths to build a powerful lineup, and enjoy a relaxing, thrilling grass-cutting experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4246640/extras/efc68813076349a5c2232d6f871de0d0.poster.avif?t=1788232487\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4246640/extras/efc68813076349a5c2232d6f871de0d0.webm?t=1788232487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4246640/extras/efc68813076349a5c2232d6f871de0d0.mp4?t=1788232487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vast Skills &amp; Equipment, Free Roguelike Building</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playable Heroes: 10 anime-style characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill System: 50+ skills to combine freely</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relic System: 80+ randomly dropped relics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4246640/extras/209e2145be047632f5b657c1f49afe96.poster.avif?t=1788232487\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4246640/extras/209e2145be047632f5b657c1f49afe96.webm?t=1788232487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4246640/extras/209e2145be047632f5b657c1f49afe96.mp4?t=1788232487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Diverse Builds, Thrilling Combat Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physical builds, spell builds, effect builds, defense builds, summon builds, transformation builds...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whatever playstyle you prefer, you can find your own way to fight in Dungeon Brawls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combining the precise skill execution of MOBA games, rich and varied systems, and exhilarating cooperative gameplay, experience an unprecedented, thrilling roguelike adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4246640/extras/1e3c74ed41d7e366df6eca3e5c400c17.poster.avif?t=1788232487\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4246640/extras/1e3c74ed41d7e366df6eca3e5c400c17.webm?t=1788232487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4246640/extras/1e3c74ed41d7e366df6eca3e5c400c17.mp4?t=1788232487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4246640/extras/c722082b7e70e67708813f7b3113c6d2.avif?t=1788232487\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4246640/extras_big/c722082b7e70e67708813f7b3113c6d2.avif?t=1788232