mation builds...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whatever playstyle you prefer, you can find your own way to fight in Dungeon Brawls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combining the precise skill execution of MOBA games, rich and varied systems, and exhilarating cooperative gameplay, experience an unprecedented, thrilling roguelike adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4246640/extras/1e3c74ed41d7e366df6eca3e5c400c17.poster.avif?t=1788232487\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4246640/extras/1e3c74ed41d7e366df6eca3e5c400c17.webm?t=1788232487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4246640/extras/1e3c74ed41d7e366df6eca3e5c400c17.mp4?t=1788232487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Dungeon Brawls is an action roguelike game that supports 4-player co-op. Choose from dozens of heroes and freely combine hundreds of skills and relics. Team up with friends, take on the challenge, and battle through waves of enemies in intense, action-packed combat!", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese, English, French, Italian, German, Russian, Japanese, Traditional Chinese, Korean, Spanish - Spain, Danish, Ukrainian, Bulgarian, Hungarian, Indonesian, Turkish, Greek, Norwegian, Czech, Polish, Thai, Swedish, Romanian, Finnish, Dutch, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Spanish - Latin America", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4246640/e1a2e5d3fb2a503a71ecad35be1530b95348ca20/header.jpg?t=1788232487", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4246640/6ee39ded4114785c45c0